            "date": "Oct 13, 2025",
            "id": "34c83c92-8cf4-418a-9f69-e5a144948e72",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for the 5‑star review. I’m glad your stay was excellent and that you enjoyed the property. I’m sorry about the mildew in both showers — that’s not our standard. We’ve notified housekeeping and maintenance to deep‑clean and treat the showers. We appreciate the feedback and hope to host you again.\n\nTammy\nRealJoy Vacations",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Our stay was excellent. It is a beautiful property. The only disappointment was the mildew that was quite bad in the Master shower. There was also mildew in the guest room shower. That is a problem that would be easily fixed and that we didn't expect in such a beautiful place otherwise.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
