            "id": "b082394b-80d1-444f-96b0-a8b8dca424e6",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Kevin, thank you for your 5-star review. We're glad the house and amenities met your expectations and that everyone enjoyed their rooms. We appreciate your feedback about the parking and hope it won’t deter you from returning. We'd love to host you again!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The house we stayed in was very nice. It was clean, had all the amenities we needed and more. New appliances, gas stove, a big master shower and soaking tub. Eveyone loved their rooms and the house in general. We all said we would love staying there again. If I had a complaint, it would be how tight the parking was. We had a full size SUV and it made for a bit of a challenge.",
